# AugMed API

FastAPI service for the first local AugMed workflow.

## Current Scope

- health and readiness checks
- local file upload for chest X-ray images
- persisted case records with SQLite by default
- mock baseline prediction generation for the first end-to-end workflow
- expert review submission
- admin dashboard summary data
